ralph/progress.txt:33434:  - The provisioning_jobs table has NO version column (unlike deployments/projects/services), so the byte-identity bystander helper relies on updated_at as the SOLE trigger-managed drift anchor (the BEFORE UPDATE provisioning_jobs_set_updated_at trigger refreshes it on every matched UPDATE). The deployment_tenant_isolation_test.go template's assertDeploymentByteIdentical compares version; the job analogue MUST NOT (the column does not exist).
