ralph/progress.txt:37704:- What was implemented: Added billing-grade `http_response_bytes` support through the existing Traefik metering vertical. The metric is now defined as `byte`/`traefik`/`metered`/billing-grade, maps to a closed `quota_resource`, writes idempotent append-only `usage_events` for fully attributed service samples, and remains tenant-scoped through the generic usage-event scope validator. The existing Traefik source adapter already collected `traefik_service_responses_bytes_total`; this story completed its runtime definition, persistence resource, and usage emission path.
