+existing Dokploy tenant hierarchy into Yalla Control Plane. It covers the
+versioned backend binaries `/usr/local/bin/yalla-api` and
+`/usr/local/bin/yalla-worker`, the support-only `POST /v1/admin/dokploy/import`
